# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 03687a356e2435bcb5cb6a062caed281f20c189bb051f4b91405abef805a7ee6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 8798aad1b02fbda63d0f36610b0f6c925e0eaa865434facec005943c597c6683
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm f976300742f8db7814aa06e9e861eba651fb0e5c2122d5211d005bc1c22cdaaa
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 6259f16f117043f86139a20f36a5b70dcdae30607de87df47d21d524277406e9
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 2e8d90025584eeb90a16ad3f0ed290c6ff464def263516faca4d24db41adcc62
